WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.891
Six choose football, four choose skipping and five choose dancing.

00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.409
Football has six votes, the most of the three games.

00:00:08.700 --> 00:00:12.497
Six plus four plus five equals fifteen learners altogether.

00:00:13.367 --> 00:00:17.676
Six minus four equals two. Football has two more votes than skipping.
